<title>PERU: Peru foreign debt totals $19.45 bln - Fujimori.</title>
<headline>Peru foreign debt totals $19.45 bln - Fujimori.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's total foreign debt obligations stand at $19.45 billion, President Alberto Fujimori said in comments published by local media Thursday.</p>
<p>That represented a $100 million rise since he took power in 1990, Fujimori added.  Without the debt restructuring deals his government has carried out, the total would have risen to $28 billion by now, he said.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
